.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4},{"type":"\ud83d\ude02","count":1},{"type":"\ud83e\udd70","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-29T15:52:01-08:00","id":1531753,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>littlewitchmaus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1531356-on-the-various-sabbat-players-guides-on-the-storyteller-s-vault#post1531356\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">so! there a number of books on (in?) the storyteller's vault related to playing sabbat characters and i was wondering if folks had any experience with them and what each's strengths and weaknesses might be.<br /> (i'm mostly looking at 'the sword of caine,' 'sabbat: the black hand,' and 'guide to the sabbat.')<br /> \u200b</div> </div> </div> </div>I've been mostly using my own houserules, heavily influenced by &quot;The Long Hard Road Out Of Hell&quot;, though without using those rules directly.<br /> Sabbat get no Touchstones in my games. The alienness of the Paths makes that impossible. So Path followers eat the full 3 stains whenever violating a Path tenet, no ability to mitigate. Also, each Path has certain strengths and weakness inspired by the Beast Marks and Path Loresheets of &quot;The Long Hard Road Out of Hell&quot;. I also dropped Predator types, as the strengths and weaknesses of the various Predator types just doesn't work in a Sabbat game. Most Sabbat wouldn't lose a Path point for being an Alleycat, for example, and a Sabbat would just eat the annoying enemy of the Siren. The Path bonuses and beast marks take the place of the Predator type bonuses and flaws.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3598-cajunkhan","name":"CajunKhan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3598_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1700"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-05T05:05:50-08:00","id":1532004,"title":"","content":"I want to read SABBAT: THE SCHISM and because of this, I am waiting for a book release as well.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":28047,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28047-lewisdavis","user":"LewisDavis","date":". 04-08-2024, 06:13 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28047-lewisdavis","name":"LewisDavis","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-11T13:37:46-07:00","id":1532389,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1531356-on-the-various-sabbat-players-guides-on-the-storyteller-s-vault?p=1531357#post1531357\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">They're releasing a book called SABBAT: THE SCHISM soon which will have the premise of &quot;The V5 Sabbat are actually not the REAL Sabbat but a breakaway bunch of dumbasses while the real Sabbat has been reforming.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>Official supplement or fan work?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","name":"Taggie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1047"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-20T05:30:45-07:00","id":1532901,"title":"","content":"Fan work, but extensive, and at least on par with what's been produced officially, it seems.